  "worked_solution": "To compute the product, we multiply each component individually:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a & =3\\cdot (4i-2j) \\\\  & =3\\cdot (4i-2j+0k) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 4i+3\\cdot (-2j)+3\\cdot 0k \\\\  & =12\\,i-6\\,j+0\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$",
